{"version":3,"kind":"Article","sha256":"88d791ee67e7c26989f8425a1a02c30f2c6bc7052f01fc8715d84f5f47892f09","slug":"index","location":"/index.md","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"Defani Arman Alfitriansyah","content_includes_title":false,"authors":[{"nameParsed":{"literal":"Defani Arman Alfitriansyah","given":"Defani Arman","family":"Alfitriansyah"},"name":"Defani Arman Alfitriansyah","id":"contributors-Users\\ASUS\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--\\63433157-e353-4831-a006-1d7091d9a721\\scratchpad\\site-myst\\myst-generated-uid-0"}],"thumbnail":"/build/hutan-mangrove-sumat-365230abffad50be83ae27cf2478a12b.jpg","exports":[{"format":"md","filename":"index.md","url":"/build/index-f0d3feffac76f7d37dba5a0f3ed272e7.md"}]},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Lulusan Kehutanan dengan spesialisasi penginderaan jauh, pemodelan karbon hutan, pemodelan ekologi, dan teknologi geospasial berbasis cloud untuk aplikasi lingkungan.","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"caFJIZksuT"}],"key":"BF8sF28QOv"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Saat ini saya bekerja di bidang agroforestri, membangun basis data GIS dan sistem WebGIS untuk mendukung pengelolaan data spasial, pemantauan, dan ketelusuran (traceability). Pekerjaan saya mencakup pengembangan dataset spasial, pengolahan dan analisis data geospasial, serta pembuatan peta dan visualisasi untuk mendukung keputusan kehutanan dan lingkungan.","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"key":"SpGaQcyCOo"}],"key":"YD5wBPB2jP"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Latar belakang riset saya berpusat pada penilaian karbon hutan, pemodelan biomassa, dan analisis spektral Sentinel-2, dengan Google Earth Engine dan ekosistem Python open-source (geemap, cartoee, cartopy, scikit-learn, pandas, matplotlib, Google Colab).","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"rmhp6fJ3Ms"}],"key":"Th3mAZNTur"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Saya juga menjadi Asisten Laboratorium GIS & Pemodelan Spasial, membimbing mahasiswa dalam GIS, penginderaan jauh, Google Earth Engine, dan analisis spasial berbasis Python.","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"key":"fJQR5dbLk9"}],"key":"XPQOqsKtCe"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Plugin QGIS saya, ","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"key":"luIMWqtWHg"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"RasterViz","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"key":"yoEAGvLxI0"}],"key":"Do7LroCO09"},{"type":"text","value":", untuk visualisasi raster bergaya Matplotlib tanpa coding, dipakai lebih dari 1.300 pengguna di seluruh dunia. Saya juga membuat plugin GeoLibre: Layout Composer dan iNaturalist Extractor.","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"key":"FYAoAcGKwR"}],"key":"nkAbtOXFWm"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Saya membagikan tutorial GIS, penginderaan jauh, dan geospasial open-source di Instagram ","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"key":"Haht750xa5"},{"type":"link","url":"https://www.instagram.com/49s.lab","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"tex